OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan moving back to
OL,4,AUK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,7,Fplanning to move back to the UK, BBC
OL,8,FNews understands.
OL,10,FPrince Harry and Meghan intend to
OL,11,Frelocate from the US later this month
OL,12,Fto a private, non-royal residence
OL,13,Foutside London as first reported by the
OL,14,FDaily Telegraph, external and the Sun,
OL,15,Fexternal.
OL,17,FThe couple's children, Prince Archie,
OL,18,Fseven, and Princess Lilibet, five, are
OL,19,Fenrolled to start at a British school
OL,20,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
